#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "0"
msgid "\nA simple trash box.\nHas the function of tucking away unneeded data files.\nAlso known as a recycle bin.\nIn Passionlip's case, the icon is set right in the middle \nof her chest for some reason.\n\nTo put it frankly, it's a pocket of imaginary space \nthat can hold anything as long as it's trash. \nIf Passionlip has crushed it into dust data, she can store \nan infinite amount, no matter how much there is.\n\nThough it may seem contradictory, even objects that exceed \nPassionlip's own memory storage can be thrown in here.\n\nAt first glance, it seems like a convenient function,\nbut since dust data can't be restored to its original form,\nit's a completely meaningless function.\nIt appears that Passionlip acquired this unique structure\nbecause she's the type of girl who bottles up her feelings,\nleading to self-destruction and self-harm.\n\n"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "1"
msgid "キーワード１偽名テキスト"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "2"
msgid "\nAlter Egos are High Servants created as\na composite amalgamation of Heroic Spirits.\n\nBB accessed the Moon Cell's Servant Archives, chose\ngoddesses compatible with each Ego, and reproduced the data.\nAlter Egos came into existence as composite goddesses.\n\nPassionlip is made up of three goddesses.\n\nThe first is the goddess of beauty from Hindu mythology,\nParvati. A goddess who loves her husband,\nthe god of destruction Shiva, with blind devotion.\n\nThe second is the goddess of war, Durga.\nConsidered a facet of Parvati, Durga possess\nten weapons given to her as divine gifts. Passionlip's\ngiant claws are an incarnation of those ten swords.\n\nThe third is a goddess of war from Scandinavia, Brynhildr.\nUnable to be joined with the hero she loved, this queen\ncalled forth destruction in her sorrow. In Wagner's opera,\nshe was rendered as Brünnhilde, who appears as a #RUBS  war maiden#RUBEvalkyrie#REND\nthat escorts the souls of the departed to Valhalla.\nIt goes without saying that this work depicts a tragedy\nwhere she despaired over love and killed her own beloved.\n\n"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "3"
msgid "キーワード２偽名テキスト"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "4"
msgid "The Noble Phantasm that BB granted this Alter Ego.\n\nThis Noble Phantasm strikes with more accuracy and damage \nthe deeper her love toward the target is. \nEven if it's utterly one-sided, \nshe will never let her loved one escape.\n\n             ◆\n\nThe Servant it was made from was the valkyrie, Brynhildr,\nof \"The Völsunga Saga.\" It is the spear of love and hatred\nshe wielded to get revenge on her husband, Sigurd,\nwho betrayed and wounded her honor. Strictly speaking,\nit's not the spear itself, but the deep love and hatred\nBrynhildr felt for Sigurd taking the shape of a spear.\n\nIn \"The Völsunga Saga,\" the fearless hero #RUBS Siegfried#RUBESigurd#REND takes\nBrynhild, who lay asleep in a ring of fire, as his wife.\nBut afterwards, Sigurd betrays her, presenting her as\nhis brother-in-law's wife. At first, Brynhild believed that\nSigurd had gotten drunk, leading him to lose his memories\nand so accepted these events as her immutable fate.\n\nHowever, she learned that Sigurd had already regained\nhis memories by then. In the end, Brynhild conspired to\nkill the man she loved most in the entire world, \nand willingly took her own life in order to follow him.\n\n"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "5"
msgid "宝具偽名"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "6"
msgid "\nA skill that allows one to act while hidden. \nThough a skill inherent to the Assassin class, perhaps\ndue to her personality, Passionlip has acquired it as well.\n\nHer Presence Concealment is excellent due to her timidness\nand caution, but her giant claws end up giving her away.\nIf it weren't for the claws, she'd make an excellent stalker.\n\nAs a side note, though no one seems to have noticed,\nshe's been following #FAMILY #GIVEN since early on,\nobserving from the shadows―or something to that effect.\n\n"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "7"
msgid "スキル１偽名テキスト"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "8"
msgid "\nA skill that increases the chance of being an enemy target\nin group battles. It sounds like a detrimental skill, but\nfor a Servant with a strong defense, possessing this skill\nallows them to function as an excellent bodyguard.\n\nAlso grants a slight defense bonus. Upon reaching A rank,\nanother special effect is added: the attacker will begin\nlosing more of their composure the more they attack, until\nfinally, the skill-holder is all they can think about.\n\n"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "9"
msgid "スキル２偽名テキスト"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "10"
msgid "\nA special ability, called id_es, \nthat Alter Egos possess since their creation.\n\nA cheat skill that evolved from \"Monstrous Strength.\"\nNo matter how much of something there may be,\nas long as it \"can be enveloped by her hands,\"\nher claws can crush and compress it, regardless.\n\nWhatever she compresses becomes a 5cm cube, but its mass\ncan't go lower than 1/10th of what it was originally.\nAfter compression, it's considered dust data.\n\nThe only things Passionlip can crush are objects smaller\nthan her hands――or not. As long as it \"fits in her hands\"\nbased on her point-of-view, she can treat it as a target.\n\nFor example, if it was a megastructure like \"the Arena,\"\nand she's in a place with an unblocked view of it all,\nthe requirements will have been met.\n\nHolding her hands out to the distant, small Arena, once\nthe entire view of the Arena fits snugly in her hands,\nLip recognizes it as \"caught\" and can now crush it.\n\nThough it may be planar physical interference that\ndisregards perspective, crushing large objects would,\nof course, take time.\n"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "11"
msgid "スキル３偽名テキスト"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "12"
msgid "\nCognitive Disorder:\nMost people can't look at themselves objectively.\nThis happens not only on the spiritual level\nbut also on the physical.\n\nPeople can't see themselves. No, to be precise,\nthe impartiality to look upon \"oneself without falsehoods\"\nand accept it is rare.\n\nBecause humans possess wisdom,\nthey're able to turn only the convenient aspects of\nthe reality they see into the truth. It's not just being\nselective of what information they accept, they're also\nunconsciously fabricating or modifying information.\n\nPassionlip's cognitive disorder is of the highest order.\nShe cannot comprehend the form of her own two hands.\nHer \"brain\" ignores her own ugly appearance, and mentally,\nshe sees herself as an exceedingly normal girl. To her,\nher claws only appear as \"normal.\" Because of this, Lip\ncan't understand the reason \"why everyone is afraid of me.\"\nCompletely ignorant that the reason is her body's ugliness,\nshe would just tilt her head if you pointed it out to her.\n\n\"Why're you telling me such a lie?\"\n\"Are you bullying me by lying again?\"\n\n             ◆\n\nIn regard to her giant claws and cognitive disorder,\nPassionlip is a complete victim.\nThough her inability to recognize it was born from\nescapism, there are neither lies or deception in her heart.\n\nEveryone finds it difficult to face their ugly sides.\nWhen one looks in the mirror, is the brain\nproperly observing the image of oneself reflected there?\n\n"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "13"
msgid "設定１偽名"
msgstr ""

#. max 6143 bytes
msgctxt "14"
msgid "\nThe End of Love & Hate:\nAn Ego born from BB's \"Desire to Court\" and \"Love & Hate.\"\nThe kind of alluring, innocent girl that men can't help\nbut lust for. The claws for her hands are embody her desire\nto protect herself from being \"an easy target for men.\"\n\n             ◆\n\nAttracted to #FAMILY #GIVEN for a certain reason,\nafter speaking in the Labyrinth, her attraction only grew.\nShe wished to be close, to touch, to talk to them, but due\nto her personality, those wishes would never be granted,\nnot even once.\n\nI want to talk (but for some reason, they're scared of me)\nso I can't talk to them,\nI want to be close (but for some reason, they run from me)\nso I can't be close,\nI want love (but they don't seem to like me)\nso I can't be loved.\n\nHer love grew deeper from that dilemma, but because of\n#FAMILY #GIVEN's rejection, love turned to sorrow.\nUnable to bear those feelings, by seeing the cause of them\nas an enemy, someone to be hated, she was just barely able\nto keep her heart from breaking.\n\nThe actions of a heart faced with a reality it couldn't\ntake while sane―――that is, a rampage akin to insanity.\n\n             ◆\n\nThe only one she loved in this entire world\ngave to her a single kindness.\n\nPassionlip will continue to cherish that miracle\nfor all eternity.\n\n……even if despair great enough to crush her heart\nis all that awaits her afterwards.\n\n"
msgstr ""

